"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, with all due respect I feel that I may have been assigned more of these tasks than the other Receptionists.\n"
" Jim said he hasn't had to do any cleaning in two weeks, yet I have been on cleaning duty 3 times.\n"
" To be clear, I certainly do not mind the extra work!  I just want to ensure you're aware in case there is a computer glitch.\n"
" Thank you and have a great day!"
